{
  "name": "umbrastudio-shell",
  "private": true,
  "version": "0.1.0",
  "description": "Umbra Studio 桌面壳（Electron）：主进程起核心，自带 Chromium 跑体检",
  "main": "main.mjs",
  "scripts": {
    "start": "electron .",
    "dist": "electron-builder --mac --arm64",
    "dist:mac": "electron-builder --mac",
    "dist:win": "electron-builder --win",
    "dist:all": "electron-builder --mac --win",
    "dist:dir": "electron-builder --mac --arm64 --dir",
    "packtest": "node packtest.mjs",
    "shelltest": "node shelltest.mjs",
    "urlguardtest": "node urlguard.mjs",
    "dist:signed": "node dist-signed.mjs",
    "signcheck": "node signcheck.mjs"
  },
  "devDependencies": {
    "electron": "^44.0.0",
    "electron-builder": "^26.0.12"
  },
  "build": {
    "appId": "com.umbrastudio.app",
    "_electronFuses说明": "见下面 electronFuses 的三条；放在这里是因为 JSON 不能写注释，而这几个值的理由比值本身长。① enableNodeOptionsEnvironmentVariable=false：关掉 NODE_OPTIONS=--require 这条注入口。已核 sandbox.ts 的 env 是白名单、故意不透传 NODE_OPTIONS（issue #24），所以关掉不碰现有功能。② enableNodeCliInspectArguments=false：关掉 --inspect 挂调试器进主进程。已核 execArgv 里只有 --permission / --allow-fs-read / --require。③ runAsNode 刻意不关（issue #138 第二步要拍板）：插件 B 面的 runner 和通道 B 的 MCP 入口都靠 ELECTRON_RUN_AS_NODE=1 起，关了打包版两处都静默失效，而开发模式一定测不出来（fuses 只写进打包的二进制）。出路是改用 Electron 的 utilityProcess.fork，但 Node 的 --permission 在 utility process 里是否同样生效没有实测过 —— 那是这条路最大的未知，要先 spike。",
    "electronFuses": {
      "enableNodeOptionsEnvironmentVariable": false,
      "enableNodeCliInspectArguments": false
    },
    "productName": "Umbra Studio",
    "directories": {
      "output": "out"
    },
    "files": [
      "main.mjs",
      "urlguard.mjs",
      "preload.cjs",
      "package.json"
    ],
    "asar": false,
    "extraResources": [
      {
        "from": "../server/dist",
        "to": "core/server/dist"
      },
      {
        "from": "../server/node_modules",
        "to": "core/server/node_modules",
        "filter": [
          "**/*",
          "!typescript/**",
          "!@types/**",
          "!.bin/**",
          "!**/*.md",
          "!**/*.map"
        ]
      },
      {
        "from": "../server/package.json",
        "to": "core/server/package.json"
      },
      {
        "from": "../runtime",
        "to": "core/runtime"
      },
      {
        "from": "../doc",
        "to": "core/doc",
        "filter": [
          "*.md"
        ]
      },
      {
        "from": "../ui",
        "to": "core/ui",
        "filter": [
          "**/*",
          "!_incoming/**"
        ]
      },
      {
        "from": "../plugins",
        "to": "core/plugins"
      },
      {
        "from": "../shared",
        "to": "core/shared"
      },
      {
        "from": "../app/dist",
        "to": "core/app/dist"
      },
      {
        "from": "../keys",
        "to": "core/keys"
      }
    ],
    "mac": {
      "target": [
        {
          "target": "dmg",
          "arch": [
            "arm64",
            "x64"
          ]
        },
        {
          "target": "zip",
          "arch": [
            "arm64",
            "x64"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "category": "public.app-category.developer-tools",
      "identity": null,
      "darkModeSupport": true,
      "hardenedRuntime": true,
      "entitlements": "build/entitlements.mac.plist",
      "entitlementsInherit": "build/entitlements.mac.plist",
      "timestamp": "http://timestamp.apple.com/ts01",
      "gatekeeperAssess": false,
      "extendInfo": {
        "CFBundleDocumentTypes": [
          {
            "CFBundleTypeName": "Folder",
            "CFBundleTypeRole": "Viewer",
            "LSHandlerRank": "Alternate",
            "LSItemContentTypes": [
              "public.folder"
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    "win": {
      "target": [
        {
          "target": "zip",
          "arch": [
            "x64",
            "arm64"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    "linux": {
      "target": [
        "dir"
      ]
    },
    "artifactName": "${productName}-${version}-${os}-${arch}.${ext}",
    "compression": "normal",
    "beforePack": "./beforePack.cjs",
    "afterPack": "./afterPack.cjs",
    "fileAssociations": [
      {
        "ext": "dc.html",
        "name": "Umbra 设计稿",
        "description": "Umbra Studio 设计稿",
        "role": "Editor",
        "rank": "Owner"
      },
      {
        "ext": [
          "md",
          "markdown",
          "txt",
          "html",
          "htm",
          "json",
          "jsonc",
          "csv",
          "tsv",
          "svg",
          "yml",
          "yaml",
          "log",
          "conf"
        ],
        "name": "文本与数据文件",
        "description": "Umbra Studio 能看能改的文件",
        "role": "Editor",
        "rank": "Alternate"
      }
    ]
  }
}
